* GENERATED BY CHARMM-GUI (http://www.charmm-gui.org) v3.7 on Apr, 25. 2024. JOBID=1409947857
* read crd files and generate Drude PSF
* NB: Water must be last segment generated do to noangle nodihedral
*

DIMENS CHSIZE 3000000 MAXRES 3000000

stream toppar_drude.str

! read coord of frag a
open read unit 10 card name fraga.crd
! read resiude name ( index ?)
read sequence coor unit 10 RESI
! generate drude particle
! Note that drude particle was initiated at the heavy atom position
generate HETA first none last none setup warn drude dmass 0.4 ! show
! read coordinates
rewind unit 10
read coor card unit 10 append

! for frag b, do the same thing
open read unit 10 card name fragb.crd
read sequence coor unit 10 RESI
generate HETB first none last none setup warn drude dmass 0.4 ! show
!read coordinates
rewind unit 10
read coor card unit 10 append

! create the drude and lone pair coordinates and set up the needed arrays
coor sdrude
coor shake

! bond H restrain
!SHAKE bonh param nofast -
!      select  .not. type D*  end -
!      select  .not. type D*  end

! no cutoff
nbonds atom vatom switch vswitch bycb -
       ctonnb 100.0 ctofnb 120.0 cutnb 16.0 -
       inbfrq -1 imgfrq -1 wmin 1.0 cdie eps 1.0

energy
! minimize drude particles
! fix the heavy atoms
CONS FIX SELECT .NOT. TYPE D* END
mini ABNR nstep 2000 nprint 20
CONS FIX SELE NONE END ! unfix these fixed atoms
energy

! in charmm-gui, harmonic constraint was used when minimizing drude particles
! cons harm force 1000000. sele .not. type D* end
! mini ABNR nstep 2000 nprint 20
! cons harm force 0. MASS sele .not. type D* end

! use INTER to calculate interaction energy. 
DEFINE MOL1 SELECT SEGID HETA END
DEFINE MOL2 SELECT SEGID HETB END
INTEraction SELE MOL1 END SELE MOL2 END UNIT 6

!write full coordinate set
open write unit 10 card name cmx_min.psf
write psf card unit 10
open write unit 10 card name cmx_min.pdb
write coor pdb unit 10
open write unit 10 card name cmx_min.crd
write coor card unit 10
coor stat sele all end
open  write unit 90 card name cmx_min.str

stop
